      <article data-ds-panel="color" hidden>
        <p class="ds-label mb-3">Foundations</p>
        <h1 class="mb-3">Color</h1>
        <p class="mb-8">Surfaces stay neutral. Color shows up as a mark, a status, or a chart — not as a wash behind content.</p>
        <h2 class="mb-3">Surfaces</h2>
        <div class="mb-8 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 @md:grid-cols-3">
          <div><div class="ds-swatch ds-swatch-canvas"></div><p class="ds-meta mt-2">Canvas</p></div>
          <div><div class="ds-swatch ds-swatch-chrome"></div><p class="ds-meta mt-2">Chrome</p></div>
          <div><div class="ds-swatch ds-swatch-well"></div><p class="ds-meta mt-2">Well</p></div>
          <div><div class="ds-swatch ds-swatch-raised"></div><p class="ds-meta mt-2">Raised</p></div>
          <div><div class="ds-swatch ds-swatch-overlay"></div><p class="ds-meta mt-2">Overlay</p></div>
          <div><div class="ds-swatch ds-swatch-ink"></div><p class="ds-meta mt-2">Ink</p></div>
        </div>
        <h2 class="mb-3">Text</h2>
        <p class="text-[var(--p-text-primary)]">Primary. Headings, body, and data.</p>
        <p>Secondary. Labels and supporting text.</p>
        <p class="ds-meta mb-8">Tertiary. Meta, timestamps, and captions.</p>
        <h2 class="mb-3">Accent and status</h2>
        <div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="ds-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="ds-meta">Accent is a mark, not a fill.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="mb-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class="ds-swatch ds-swatch-success !h-8 w-16"></span>
          <span class="ds-swatch ds-swatch-warning !h-8 w-16"></span>
          <span class="ds-swatch ds-swatch-danger !h-8 w-16"></span>
          <span class="ds-swatch ds-swatch-info !h-8 w-16"></span>
        </div>
        <p class="ds-meta mb-6">Success, warning, danger, and info. Danger is not the accent.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class="ds-chart ds-chart-0"></span>
          <span class="ds-chart ds-chart-1"></span>
          <span class="ds-chart ds-chart-2"></span>
          <span class="ds-chart ds-chart-3"></span>
          <span class="ds-chart ds-chart-4"></span>
          <span class="ds-chart ds-chart-5"></span>
          <span class="ds-chart ds-chart-6"></span>
          <span class="ds-chart ds-chart-7"></span>
          <span class="ds-chart ds-chart-8"></span>
          <span class="ds-chart ds-chart-9"></span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article data-ds-panel="typography" hidden>
        <p class="ds-label mb-3">Foundations</p>
        <h1 class="mb-3">Typography</h1>
        <p class="mb-8">One sans for the interface. Mono is for code only. Figures in data stay tabular.</p>
        <p class="!text-[24px] !font-semibold !leading-tight !text-[var(--p-text-primary)]">Page title</p>
        <p class="!text-[20px] !font-semibold !text-[var(--p-text-primary)]">Section title</p>
        <p class="!text-[16px] !font-semibold !text-[var(--p-text-primary)]">Card title</p>
        <p class="!text-[var(--p-text-primary)]">Default interface text.</p>
        <p class="!text-[13px]">Dense body.</p>
        <p class="ds-meta">Meta.</p>
        <p class="ds-label mt-4">Overline</p>
        <p class="ds-code">IBM Plex Mono — code only.</p>
        <p class="ds-stat !text-[24px] !text-[var(--p-text-primary)]">1,284.00</p>
      </article>

      <article data-ds-panel="identity" hidden>
        <p class="ds-label mb-3">Foundations</p>
        <h1 class="mb-3">App Identity</h1>
        <p class="mb-8">A mark and a name. The mark carries the accent. The name stays in the interface typeface.</p>
        <div class="ds-panel flex items-center gap-3 p-4">
          <span class="grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center rounded-md bg-[var(--p-ink)] text-[13px] font-semibold text-[var(--p-text-inverse)]">DS</span>
          <span class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-[var(--p-text-primary)]">Design System</span>
          <span class="ds-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article data-ds-panel="buttons" hidden>
        <p class="ds-label mb-3">Components</p>
        <h1 class="mb-3">Buttons</h1>
        <p class="mb-8">One primary action per view, in ink. Accent never fills a button. Danger is a separate control.</p>
        <div class="mb-4 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
          <button type="button" class="button">Save</button>
          <button type="button" class="button-secondary">Cancel</button>
          <button type="button" class="ds-btn ds-btn-ghost">Ghost</button>
          <button type="button" class="ds-btn ds-btn-danger">Delete</button>
          <button type="button" class="ds-btn ds-btn-danger-subtle">Remove</button>
          <button type="button" class="ds-btn ds-btn-link">View record</button>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
          <button type="button" class="button ds-btn-sm">Small</button>
          <button type="button" class="button">Medium</button>
          <button type="button" class="button ds-btn-lg">Large</button>
          <button type="button" class="button" disabled>Disabled</button>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article data-ds-panel="links" hidden>
        <p class="ds-label mb-3">Components</p>
        <h1 class="mb-3">Links</h1>
